The '''Lurmen village''' was comprised of a group of [[Lurmen]] who colonized the remote [[planet]] [[Maridun]] in order to escape from the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Lurmen" /> The homes of the village were erected using local natural material, consisting of giant seed pods with a stabilizing base and openings for ventilation and light.<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

